{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A grizzled private eye in a sci-fi adventure takes a murder case no one else will touch. He\u2019s seen it all before, but nothing\u2019s prepared him for a conspiracy that leads off-world. Something big is about to happen. Whatever it is... it goes live at midnight. <br><br>The top lawyer of showbiz is shot dead, and that\u2019s where private eye Simm Gurnett steps in. Something\u2019s rancid big time, so much so that even the police won\u2019t touch the case. And for good reason: the killer is rumored to be not of this world.   <br><br>The assassin is far from finished. The killing was only an opening move.<br><br><strong>Game features</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Immersive sci-fi pixel art.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Play as a cynical private detective.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Explore the city that never sleeps.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Engage with its mutant inhabitants.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Solve the case, sidestep into humor.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Point and click puzzles &amp; item inventory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Steam achievements!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3909740?t=1772719156","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3909740/be56b48d61298749e00a7016d3198ed55247e3d9/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1772719156","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3909740/7876742a3ed73a6c0e3dff9ce0a2bd5118d58eee/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1772719156","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3909740/7876742a3ed73a6c0e3dff9ce0a2bd5118d58eee/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1772719156","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":